}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-06-11T06:47:39Z","updated_at":"2026-06-18T15:27:26Z","closed_at":"2026-06-18T15:25:20Z","assignee":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducable in: 4.6.2.stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.2.stable - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated AMD Radeon(TM) Graphics (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 31.0.21924.61) - AMD Ryzen 5 5600GT with Radeon Graphics (12 threads) - 15.39 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe emoji 🕵🏻‍♀️ `Woman Detective: Light Skin Tone Emoji` and 🕵🏻‍♂️ `Man Detective: Light Skin Tone Emoji` doesn't render properly on the editor unless a preceding emoji is present first.\n\nFor instance, when I copy-paste a 🕵🏻‍♀️ `Woman Detective: Light Skin Tone Emoji` on the `text` property of a `Button` thru inspector/editor or code, it turns into its components 🕵️ `Detective Emoji`, 🏻 `Light Skin Tone Emoji`, and ♀️ `Female Sign Emoji` respectively.\n\nHowever, if I put these emojis together, plus a '‍' `Zero Width Joiner Emoji`, it all combines into 1 emoji as intended e.g. 🕵🏻‍♀️.\n\nI'm not sure if the zero width joiner is present or not on 🕵️ 🏻♀️ whenever it shows up as it is treated as a single character whenever I move the caret/text cursor on it.\n\nFor other emojis like 👩‍👩‍👧👩‍👩‍👦‍👦👩🏽‍🤝‍👩🏻 where they're made out of other emojis they just work fine being copy-pasted.\n\nRegardless, as a workaround, I just put the mentioned emojis together to make the single emoji, which is then treated as a single character.\n\n---\n\n### Screenshots from a personal project\nUsing *Emoji and Symbols* menu\n\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1040\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2201b68a-f484-48ae-afe6-e0c59a70a2b1\" />\n\nvs  \nCopy-pasting from other sources vs copy-pasting the manually written emoji\n\n<img width=\"1556\" height=\"564\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6dd82336-769b-4fef-9d8b-f0019dd72b05\" />\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n### Button\n1. Copy-paste 🕵🏻‍♀️ to `text` property in the inspector/editor\n2. It displays as 🕵️ 🏻♀️ and treated as a single character\n\n### LineEdit\n1. Copy-paste 🕵🏻‍♀️ to `text` property in the inspector/editor\n2. It displays as 🕵️ 🏻♀️ and treated as a single character\n\n### Emoji and Symbols menu\n1. In `LineEdit` make sure `emoji_menu_enabled` is `true`\n2. Right click to show and access its `PopupMenu`\n3. Select `Emoji & Symbols`\n4. Under the emoji panel, go to `People > Light Skin Tone > 🕵🏻‍♀️`\n5. Select it to append on `LineEdit`'s text\n6. It displays as 🕵️ 🏻♀️ and treated as a single character\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[EmojiBroken.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/28825569/EmojiBroken.zip)\n\nThis is a small project intended to test the 'broken' and 'fixed' emojis on `Button`, `LineEdit`, and `RichTextLabel` nodes.\n\n<img width=\"602\" height=\"512\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/eed3a9bf-89e0-40c9-989e-38819d23c235\" />","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120182/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120182/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}